     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I have recently started using the &quot;pool&quot; package for managing my database connections in shiny.</div><div><br></div><div>I use it like this..</div><div><br></div><div>Open a new pool object using dbPool()</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">poolx </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dbPool</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">RMySQL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#606\">MySQL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                      host </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;54.251.XXX.XX&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      dbname</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;db in use&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      user </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;user&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      password </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rstudioapi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">askForPassword</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Database password&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>    numericInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;nrows&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;How many rows to show?&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    tableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tbl&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   <br>    output$tbl </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        src_pool</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">poolx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tbl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;archive&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$nrows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        on</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">exit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dbDisconnect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">poolx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Am I doing something incorrectly as I get this error on the shiny webpage output.</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">&#39;src_sql&#39; is not an exported object from &#39;namespace:dplyr&#39;</span></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Also, I get this stack of warnings on the console </div><div><br></div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">Warning: You still have checked out objects. Return them to the pool so they can be destroyed. (If these are leaked objects - no reference - they will be destroyed the next time the garbage collector runs).<br>Warning in force(expr) :<br>  You have a leaked pooled object. Destroying it.<br>Warning: Error in : &#39;src_sql&#39; is not an exported object from &#39;namespace:dplyr&#39;<br>Stack trace (innermost first):<br>    85: getExportedValue<br>    84: ::<br>    83: src_pool<br>    82: eval<br>    81: eval<br>    80: %&gt;%<br>    79: renderTable [/Users/sm/Dropbox/R-wd/dynamic_table/show_logs.R#30]<br>    78: func<br>    77: origRenderFunc<br>    76: output$tbl<br>     1: runApp</blockquote></div><div><br></div></div>"
