pan style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">poolx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tbl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;archive&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$nrows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        on</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">exit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dbDisconnect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">poolx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Am I doing something incorrectly as I get this error on the shiny webpage output.</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">&#39;src_sql&#39; is not an exported object from &#39;namespace:dplyr&#39;</span></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Also, I get this stack of warnings on the console </div><div><br></div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">Warning: You still have checked out objects. Return them to the pool so they can be destroyed. (If these are leaked objects - no reference - they will be destroyed the next time the garbage collector runs).<br>Warning in force(expr) :<br>  You have a leaked pooled object. Destroying it.<br>Warning: Error in : &#3